### Get cart by customer (auto-create)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/carts/customer/{{customerId}}

### Add item to cart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/carts/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update item quantity
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/carts/items/{{itemId}}/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Checkout cart
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/carts/{{cartId}}/checkout
